<h3 id="B.-UMAP-%E2%80%93-Uniform-Manifold-Approximation-and-Projection">B. UMAP – Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection<a class="anchor-link" href="#B.-UMAP-%E2%80%93-Uniform-Manifold-Approximation-and-Projection">¶</a></h3><p>UMAP is a non-linear dimensionality reduction technique that preserves both local and global structure in data. It is especially effective at capturing complex relationships and clusters in high-dimensional datasets. UMAP is widely used for visualization tasks where the data has non-linear patterns, such as in housing prices.</p>
</div>
